    },
    {
      "chord_quality": "dom7",
      "function_role": "flux-reflux-tension-and-release",
      "narrative": "Over a sustained D7(9) vamp, Benson prescribes constructing Giant Lines that create and release harmonic tension within the line itself -- the Flux and Reflux technique. Chapters 5 and 7 deepen this practice progressively, establishing that tension generation and resolution is a trainable melodic skill. Chapters 5 and 7, pp. 15-37.",
